  "goodToKnow": "Der Baumarkt is a DIY or hardware store, with chains like OBI, Hornbach, Bauhaus and toom. Germans love Heimwerken (DIY), and Saturday morning at the Baumarkt is a cliché. Since shops are closed on Sundays (Ladenschluss), Saturday is the only weekend shopping day. Der Heimwerker is a DIY enthusiast, and die Bohrmaschine (drill) is a classic tool. Plural: die Baumärkte."
